{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50772","headline":"贫居遣愤 · 张祜","name":"贫居遣愤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筑室枕隋流，贫居喜自由。\n未爲齐国悲，争免鲁人丘。\n不畏长堪耻，无成久更羞。\n家须男子继，国合丈夫忧。\n苟利他相与，诛当我自求。\n轮回飜碍直，劒折却思柔。\n老虎终开眼，微虫会叩头。\n但令吾舌在，何畏不封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}